---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="HTML5 Video Embed Code Generator" seo={{ page_description: "Generate responsive HTML5 video embed codes." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 prose">
    <h1>HTML5 Video Embed Code Generator</h1>
    <p>Use this tool to generate a clean, responsive HTML5 <code>&lt;video&gt;</code> tag with standard attributes. Perfect for self-hosting simple MP4s.</p>

    <div class="bg-[var(--color-bg-surface)] border border-[var(--color-border)] rounded p-6 my-8 not-prose">
      <form id="embed-form" class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Video URL (MP4)</label>
          <input type="url" id="embed-url" placeholder="https://example.com/video.mp4" class="w-full rounded border border-[var(--color-border)] px-3 py-2" required />
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Poster Image URL (Optional)</label>
          <input type="url" id="embed-poster" placeholder="https://example.com/poster.jpg" class="w-full rounded border border-[var(--color-border)] px-3 py-2" />
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
          <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input type="checkbox" id="attr-controls" checked /> Controls
          </label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input type="checkbox" id="attr-autoplay" /> Autoplay
          </label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input type="checkbox" id="attr-muted" /> Muted
          </label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input type="checkbox" id="attr-loop" /> Loop
          </label>
          <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <input type="checkbox" id="attr-playsinline" checked /> PlaysInline
          </label>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-2 text-white font-medium mt-4">Generate Code</button>
      </form>

      <div id="embed-result" class="hidden mt-8">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Your Embed Code:</h3>
        <div class="relative">
          <textarea id="out-code" class="w-full h-48 rounded bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-4 font-mono text-sm mb-2" readonly></textarea>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Includes a wrapper for responsive 16:9 scaling.</p>
      </div>

      <noscript>
        <div class="mt-8 p-4 bg-gray-50 border-l-4 border-[var(--color-primary)]">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">How to build an embed tag manually</h3>
          <p>Since JavaScript is disabled, here is a standard template you can copy and edit:</p>
          <pre class="bg-white p-4 border border-gray-200 rounded text-sm overflow-x-auto">
&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;"&gt;
  &lt;video controls playsinline poster="YOUR_POSTER_URL" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;"&gt;
    &lt;source src="YOUR_VIDEO_URL.mp4" type="video/mp4"&gt;
    Your browser does not support the video tag.
  &lt;/video&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
          </pre>
        </div>
      </noscript>
    </div>

    <h2>Why use a wrapper?</h2>
    <p>By default, video tags maintain their aspect ratio based on their intrinsic size. A wrapper with <code>padding-bottom: 56.25%</code> (for 16:9) ensures the video container is responsive and prevents layout shifts (CLS) as the video loads.</p>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded border border-gray-200">
      <h3 class="mt-0">Tired of managing raw MP4s?</h3>
      <p>uVideoPlayer handles adaptive streaming, so you don't have to choose between quality and speed.</p>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="inline-block rounded bg-[var(--color-primary)] px-5 py-2 text-white font-medium no-underline hover:bg-[var(--color-primary-dark)]">See Plans</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.getElementById('embed-form')?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();

    const url = (document.getElementById('embed-url') as HTMLInputElement).value;
    const poster = (document.getElementById('embed-poster') as HTMLInputElement).value;

    const controls = (document.getElementById('attr-controls') as HTMLInputElement).checked ? ' controls' : '';
    const autoplay = (document.getElementById('attr-autoplay') as HTMLInputElement).checked ? ' autoplay' : '';
    const muted = (document.getElementById('attr-muted') as HTMLInputElement).checked ? ' muted' : '';
    const loop = (document.getElementById('attr-loop') as HTMLInputElement).checked ? ' loop' : '';
    const playsinline = (document.getElementById('attr-playsinline') as HTMLInputElement).checked ? ' playsinline' : '';

    const posterAttr = poster ? ` poster="${poster}"` : '';

    const code = `<div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;">
  <video${controls}${autoplay}${muted}${loop}${playsinline}${posterAttr} style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
    <source src="${url}" type="video/mp4">
    Your browser does not support the video tag.
  </video>
</div>`;

    document.getElementById('out-code')!.textContent = code;
    document.getElementById('embed-result')!.classList.remove('hidden');
  });
</script>
